## 🚚 Inventory & Logistics Workflows

### 8. Inventory Synchronization (Multi-Warehouse)

```
Background Job: Every 15 minutes

1. Cron job triggers inventory sync
   ↓
2. Fetch all warehouses
   ↓
3. For each product:
   ├─→ Aggregate stock across warehouses
   │   - SUM(warehouse.stock) by productId
   ├─→ Calculate totals:
   │   - totalStock = SUM(all warehouse stock)
   │   - reservedStock (from active carts/orders)
   │   - availableStock = totalStock - reservedStock
   ├─→ Update Inventory record (atomic)
   └─→ Check low stock threshold
       - If availableStock < minStock:
         ├─→ Queue low stock alert
         └─→ Notify warehouse manager
   ↓
4. Cache updated inventory (Redis)
   - Key: `cache:inventory:${productId}`
   - TTL: 2 minutes
   ↓
5. Log sync completion
```

---

### 9. Order Shipment Flow

```
1. Order status: PAID
   ↓
2. Warehouse selection logic
   - Check inventory closest to delivery address
   - Select warehouse with sufficient stock
   ↓
3. Create Shipment record
   - orderId
   - warehouseId
   - items
   - trackingNumber (generate/external)
   ↓
4. Update Order status: PROCESSING
   ↓
5. **[DISTRIBUTED LOCK]**
   ├─→ Acquire lock: `lock:inventory:${productId}`
   ├─→
   ├─→ Reduce inventory (atomic)
   │   - reservedStock -= quantity
   │   - soldStock += quantity
   ├─→
   └─→ Release lock
   ↓
6. Assign logistics partner
   - Internal delivery team
   - Or third-party integration (future)
   ↓
7. Update Shipment status: SHIPPED
   ↓
8. Update Order status: SHIPPED
   ↓
9. Queue shipment notification
   - Email with tracking link
   - SMS with tracking number
   - Push notification
   ↓
10. Start delivery tracking
    - Real-time location updates (future)
    - Estimated delivery time
   ↓
11. On delivery completion:
    ├─→ Update Shipment status: DELIVERED
    ├─→ Update Order status: DELIVERED
    ├─→ Queue delivery confirmation
    └─→ Request review/rating
```

