## ⚠️ Error Handling & Recovery

### 12. Failed Job Recovery

```
Scenario: Email sending fails

1. Job in emailQueue fails
   ↓
2. BullMQ retry mechanism
   - Attempt 1: Immediate retry
   - Attempt 2: After 2 seconds
   - Attempt 3: After 4 seconds (exponential backoff)
   ↓
3. If all retries exhausted:
   ├─→ Move to failed queue
   ├─→ Log error with full context
   ├─→ Alert operations team (if critical)
   └─→ Store in dead letter queue
   ↓
4. Admin reviews failed jobs dashboard
   ↓
5. Options:
   ├─→ Retry job manually
   ├─→ Edit job data and retry
   └─→ Discard job
```

